sequenceDiagram
  participant Student
  participant UI as React Register
  participant API as Express
  participant DB as Atlas
  Student->>UI: Name, student number, email, chosen password and confirmation
  UI->>API: Obtain CSRF token
  UI->>API: POST auth/register
  API->>API: Strict schema, quotas and bounded concurrency
  API->>API: bcrypt hash with 72-byte input guard
  API->>DB: Begin transaction
  API->>DB: Insert User with server-owned ROLE_STUDENT
  API->>DB: Insert minimum StudentProfile and audit
  alt Duplicate email or student number
    API->>DB: Roll back all writes
    API-->>UI: 409, no partial account
  else Unique account
    API->>DB: Commit
    API-->>UI: 201, no password in response
    UI->>UI: Navigate to login
    Student->>API: Existing login with email and chosen password
    API-->>Student: HttpOnly session cookie
    Student->>API: Read dashboard with minimum profile
    Student->>API: PATCH students/me with complete profile
    API->>DB: Own profile update and audit in transaction
  end
